relationship: PREFER:8000020 PREFER:0000054 ! setpoint of stirrer speed measurement variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000029
name: pressure cultivation condition
def: "A cultivation condition that represents the pressure related aspects of a fermentation cultivation process, grouping process control varibales and process measurement variables that describe or regulate the pressure state within the cultivation environment." []
is_a: PREFER:0000008 ! cultivation condition

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000030
name: aeration gas type control variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process dissolved oxygen control variable that represents the type of gas used for aeration in a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process, which may include aire or specific gases such as pure oxygen, nitrogen or carbon dioxide." []
synonym: "precision fermentation process aeration gas type control variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000015 ! operational parameter
is_a: PREFER:0000119 ! dissolved oxygen control variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000031
name: maximum aeration setpoint control variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process dissolved oxygen control variable that represents the target maximum rate of at which gas can be supplied to be regulated and or maintained within a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "maximum aeration setpoint" EXACT []
synonym: "precision fermentation process maximum aeration setpoint control variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000015 ! operational parameter
is_a: PREFER:0000119 ! dissolved oxygen control variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 uom:L.min-1 ! has value specification liter per minute
relationship: PREFER:8000020 PREFER:0000055 ! setpoint of air flow rate measurement variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000032
name: minimum aeration setpoint control variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process dissolved oxygen control variable that represents the target minimum rate of at which gas can be supplied to be regulated and or maintained within a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "minimum aeration setpoint" EXACT []
synonym: "precision fermentation process minimum aeration setpoint control variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000015 ! operational parameter
is_a: PREFER:0000119 ! dissolved oxygen control variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 uom:L.min-1 ! has value specification liter per minute
relationship: PREFER:8000020 PREFER:0000055 ! setpoint of air flow rate measurement variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000033
name: dissolved oxygen cultivation condition
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A cultivation condition that represents the dissolved oxygen related aspects of a fermentation cultivation process, grouping process control varibales and process measurement variables that describe or regulate the concentration of oxygen dissolved in the cultivation environment." []
synonym: "DO cultivation condition" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000008 ! cultivation condition

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000034
name: starting optical density measurement variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process measurement variable that indicates the initial optical density (OD) of the fermentation culture from a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
comment: The starting OD measurement is either measured (by taking a sample after inoculation and measuring the cell density spectophotometrically at 600nm or 900nm wavelength) or  calculated (by knowing the final OD of the seed culture, volume inoculated and final cultivation volume).
synonym: "precision fermentation process starting optical density measurement variable" EXACT []
synonym: "starting OD measurement variable" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000045 ! optical density cultivation condition
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation process measurement variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:7000006 ! has value specification unit of optical density

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000035
name: final seed optical density measurement variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process measurement variable that indicates the cell density of the seed culture for the process at the time it is inoculated  to the bioreactor or fermentation system." []
synonym: "final seed OD measurement variable" EXACT []
synonym: "precision fermentation project final seed optical density measurement variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000073 ! seed cultivation condition
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation process measurement variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:7000006 ! has value specification unit of optical density

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000036
name: initial culture volume measurement variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process measurement variable that indicates the total volume of the culture of a bioreactor or fermentation system, at the beginning of the process, representing the sum of fermentation medium and seed culture." []
synonym: "initial production culture volume measurement variable" EXACT []
synonym: "precision fermentation process initial culture volume measurement variable" EXACT []
synonym: "starting culture volume measurement variable" EXACT []
synonym: "starting production culture volume measurement variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000046 ! volume cultivation condition
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation process measurement variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:9000004 ! has value specification unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000037
name: feed medium cultivation condition
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A fermentation medium cultivation condition that represents the feed related aspects of a fermentation cultivation process, grouping process control varibales and process measurement variables that describe or regulate the addition and state of fresh feed media within the cultivation environment." []
is_a: PREFER:0000024 ! fermentation medium cultivation condition
relationship: PREFER:8000013 PREFER:0000189 ! has feed profile type feed profile type control variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000038
name: batch medium pH measurement variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process measurement variable that indicates the negative decadic logarithm of the hydrogen ion concentration in the batch fermentation medium of a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "precision fermentation project batch medium pH measurement variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000024 ! fermentation medium cultivation condition
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation process measurement variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 uom:%5BpH%5D ! has value specification pH based unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000039
name: dissolved oxygen measurement variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process measurement variable that indicates the concentration of oxygen molecules (O₂) dissolved in the fermentation medium of a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "DO measurement variable" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
synonym: "precision fermentation process dissolved oxygen measurement variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000033 ! dissolved oxygen cultivation condition
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation process measurement variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:7000007 ! has value specification dimensionless unit
relationship: PREFER:8000012 PREFER:0000150 ! has data acquisition quality data acquisition quality

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000040
name: pH measurement variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process measurement variable that indicates the potential of hydrogen of the production culture from a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "precision fermentation process pH measurement variable" EXACT []
xref: NCIT:C205029
is_a: PREFER:0000005 ! alkaline cultivation condition
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation process measurement variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 uom:%5BpH%5D ! has value specification pH based unit
relationship: PREFER:8000012 PREFER:0000150 ! has data acquisition quality data acquisition quality

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000041
name: temperature measurement variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process measurement variable that indicates the temerature of the production culture from a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "precision fermentation process temperature measurement variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000007 ! temperature cultivation condition
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation process measurement variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:9000004 ! has value specification unit
relationship: PREFER:8000012 PREFER:0000150 ! has data acquisition quality data acquisition quality

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000042
name: pressure measurement variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
