namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A respiratory rate metric that represents the rate at which carbon dioxide is released by the cell culture in a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
comment: Physical gas transfer. Dynamic respiratory metric
synonym: "CER variable" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
synonym: "co2 evolution rate variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory rate metric
