def: "A respiratory rate metric that represent the ratio of carbon dioxide produced/formed to oxygen consumed during cellular metabolism in a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process, commmonly used to assess the metabolic state of cells." []
comment: Derived metabolic indicator.
synonym: "RQ variable" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory rate metric
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:7000007 ! has value specification dimensionless unit

