def: "A precision fermentation process dissolved oxygen control variable indicates the target percentage of oxygen value to be regulated and maintained in the gas mixture that is being supplied to a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "precision fermentation process inlet air oxygen setpoint control variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000119 ! dissolved oxygen control variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000115
name: specific compound production rate variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A bioproduction rate metric that represents the rate of compound produced per unit of biomass, in a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process, providing the efficiency of compound production relative to biomass." []
synonym: "specific compound bioproduction rate variable" EXACT []
synonym: "specific compound formation rate variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000159 ! bioproduction rate metric
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:9000004 ! has value specification unit

[Term]
