[Term]
id: PREFER:0000133
name: carbon dioxide yield (biomass) variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A process yield metric that represents the yield of carbon dioxide produced per biomass (X), describing how much carbon dioxide is produced relative to the amount of biomass generated in a bioreactor or fermentation system, during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "carbo dioxide yield (X) variable" EXACT []
synonym: "co2 yield (X) variable" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000155 ! process yield metric
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:7000000 ! has value specification mole per carbon mole

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000134
name: biomass amount variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A biomass balance metric that represents the absolute quantity of cellular biomass present in a bioreactor or fermentation system, at a certain time point, during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "biomass amount calculated variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000161 ! biomass balance metric
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:9000004 ! has value specification unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000135
name: genomics sample calculated variable
def: "An omics sample calculated variable that represents genomic values derived from computational analysis using DNA sequence data from an offline sample associated with a fermentation process." []
is_a: PREFER:0000209 ! omics sample calculated variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000136
name: biomass lost in sampling variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
